<header><p class="enc-kicker">Event · other</p><h1 class="enc-title">Assassination of Uthman</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">656 CE</span></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The assassination of Uthman was the killing of the third <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/rashidun-caliphate">Rashidun</a> <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/caliphate">caliph</a>, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/uthman-ibn-affan">Uthman ibn Affan</a>, by rebels in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/medina">Medina</a> in 656 CE. Discontent with his appointments and policies had led to unrest in the provinces. His murder triggered the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/first-fitna">First Fitna</a>, the civil war that undermined the Rashidun Caliphate.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/assassination-of-uthman.jpg" alt="Assassination of Uthman" width="320" height="327" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Vikiçizer · CC BY-SA 4.0 · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Ayasofya_13_(cropped).JPG" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
